1. UPSTREAM — WHOSE WORK THIS IS BUILT ON
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GottFA80 / GottFA80_PLuS
    Copyright (c) 2020-2026 bontango
    https://github.com/bontango/GottFA80   —   https://www.lisy.dev
    Licence: GNU GPL v3 or later.

    A VHDL re-implementation of the Gottlieb System 80 / 80A / 80B MPU board.
    Essentially everything structural in this tree is bontango's: the top level
    SYS80.vhd, the memory map and address decode, the RIOT/display/lamp/solenoid
    plumbing, boot_message, read_the_dips, EEprom, SD_Card, GOSOF80 and its sound
    chain, attract, anti_thunk, detect_sw, cpu_clk_gen, the SN74xx models, and
    the Quartus project itself.  The starting point for this fork was
    GottFA80_PLuS v2.0 / v611 for HW 2.1x (10CL006YE144C8G), itself based on
    GottFA80S V501.  Individual per-file attributions are in the file headers
    and have been left intact.

    The LISY project (lisy.dev) is bontango's; "LISYcontrol" in this tree names
    the diagnostic bridge that speaks to that ecosystem.


