MODULES ADDED IN THIS FORK (Pstore, GPL-3 — see the caveat above)

  lib_common/nor_flash.vhd        boot the game ROM from an external SPI NOR
                                  instead of the microSD card.
  lib_common/spi_slave.vhd        SPI slave for the diagnostic bridge.
  lib_common/lisyctrl.vhd         LISYcontrol diagnostic bridge: switch matrix,
                                  coils, lamps, sound, 2x20 text, watchdog.
  lib_common/disp80b_diag.vhd     80B alphanumeric TEXT writer for diag mode
                                  (10941 latch protocol).  Present but OFF —
                                  behind the disp80b_diag_enable generic.
